<section id="story" class="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">01 / OUR STORY</span>

    <h2 id="story-title">
      A place to belong.<br />
      <em>A reason to keep going.</em>
    </h2>

    <img
      class="story-photo"
      src="/images/story.jpg"
      alt="Community members standing together facing demolished buildings in Silwan"
      loading="lazy"
      width="1600"
      height="1200"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="story-text">
    <p class="lead">
      Established in 2012, Al-Bustan Association grew from the community’s
      youth efforts to support families facing demolition threats,
      displacement, and the pressures of everyday life in Silwan.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our roots extend to the Al-Bustan community tent, established in
      2002—a place for people to gather, organize, and express their hopes
      for the future.
    </p>

    <p>
      These roots continue to guide our work. We create spaces where children
      can learn and play, young people can develop their talents, and women
      and families can find support and opportunities.
    </p>

    <p>
      In November 2024, our headquarters and community tent were demolished.
      Despite this loss, we continued delivering activities and supporting
      the community through alternative spaces and partnerships.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline">
    <div>
      <strong>2002</strong>
      <span>A tent brings the community together</span>
    </div>

    <div>
      <strong>2012</strong>
      <span>Al-Bustan Association is established</span>
    </div>

    <div>
      <strong>Today</strong>
      <span>Our community work continues</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

